Subject: [PATCH] Point contact/order forms at a configurable backend URL

- Add src/lib/apiUrl.js helper: uses VITE_API_URL when set, otherwise
  falls back to Vite's BASE_URL (same-origin relative requests)
- Update Contact.jsx and Order.jsx to use the helper instead of the
  BASE_URL-only path
- Add .env.example documenting VITE_API_URL
- Ignore local .env files in git (keep .env.example tracked)

Note: an untracked .env with VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:7004 was
also created locally for dev, but is intentionally not committed.
